= January 2026 — A successor without a safe list

The first online runoff is annulled. The rerun gives Pełczyńska-Nałęcz a narrow
victory over Hennig-Kloska, leaving almost half the party organised around the
loser while both camps fear the electoral threshold.

- @p2050_accept
- @p2050_mediate
- @p2050_exploit

