= February 2026 — An alliance is not one relationship

Ambassador Tom Rose breaks contact after Czarzasty rejects a Nobel nomination
for Donald Trump and criticises the treatment of allies. Defence, intelligence,
Congress, the foreign ministry, the President and the Sejm still have separate
channels.

